                    <h1 class="connect-content__heading">AACTA Celebrates Screen Craft Winners at Industry Luncheon in Sydney</h1>
                    <p class="connect-content__description">This year’s AACTA Award winners in creative excellence were announced today in Sydney at the 2019 AACTA Awards Industry Luncheon presented by Foxtel, held at The Star Event Centre. Thirty-two Awards were presented, primarily honouring outstanding screen craft and technical achievement across industry sectors.</p>
                    
